window.products.push({"id":397197,"name":"ZMYGOLON Bento Lunch Box for Kids, Lunch Bento Box Container Leak-proof for Kids Adults Teens School, Lunch Containers with 3 Compartments and Cup,Lun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lb1KgQdVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Partition,No Tainting】This kids bento lunch box has 3 compartments. High partition and seal hermetically tight. Don't worry about tainting taste. Lunch bento box for kids can meet with kid's daily diet needs. Such as: vegetables, fruit salad, sandwiches, sushi, curry, etc. Effectively separated and keep fresh. In addition, you will get three cutleries（knife,fork,spoon）. Stored on the top of lunch bento box. 【Leak-proof Design,Perfect Size】Leak-proof design Lunch bento box. Design with four latches. Easy to open and close. Top cover of lunch bento box is embedded with a silicone sealing ring. It can effectively prevent leakage of meal liquid. Bento lunch box for kids set contians a cleaning cloth. Lunch box container measures:8.2 x 5.5 x 2.5 inches. Lightweight and easy for carrying. 【Perfect Set,Safe Material】Lunch box container for kids includes a nutrition cup（spoon inside）to meet your daily nutrition. Such as milkshakes, juice, milk, etc. Fruit fork is can be used for eating fruit salad and convenient for parent-child interaction. Kids bento box set is made of food-grade PP materials.BPA free. Non-moldy and durable. 【Large Lunch Bag】Made of aluminum foil inner layer and oxford cloth outer layer. Keep fresh for up to 5 hours. Lunch bag can keep food warm or cold (you need ice packs to freeze food). Lunch bag size: 11*6*7.5 inches. In addition to enough space for bento box and cup, it can also store appetizers, snack and fruits. 【Dishwasher, Microwave Safe】The inner tray of kids bento lunch box can be placed in microwave to heat food (without lid, 2-4 minutes below 248 degrees Fahrenheit). The inner tray can be washed in the dishwasher (But Recommend：Hand wash the lid of bento box. Because long-term machine washing will cause deformation). Bento lunch box set includes: bento box*1, knife*1, fork*1, spoon*1, nutrition cup*1, cleaning cloth *1,fruit fork *10, lunch bag*1. <br>Recommend Age Grade: Over 3 years old.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lb1KgQdVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZMYGOLON","source_asin":"B0BVTMDQBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVTMDQBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVTMDQBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
