window.products.push({"id":397211,"name":"Legendary Nut Milk Bag - Large Reusable 10\"x12\" Commercial Food Grade Almond Milk Maker, Food Strainer, Fine Mesh Nylon Cheesecloth, Filter Cold Brew ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m8DqNVYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your search for the perfect food strainer is finally over. When you purchase Munk Munk's Legendary Nut Milk Bag today, here's what you should do: buy some almonds, tune up your blender and get ready to drink the most delicious almond milk you've ever tasted! When your package arrives, rip it open the first chance you get.   Take out your Munk Munk's Legendary Nut Milk Bag and admire the hermetically-sealed reusable mylar packaging. Rip off the tab and pull out your brand new nut milk bag. With nut milk bags we have owned in the past, we never knew where was a good place to store them. So we designed a reusable package to keep your bag clean and protected in between uses. Great for Cauliflower Pizza! Now get out your food processor and whip up your first batch of cauliflower pizza crust. You can strain all the water from your cauliflower in seconds.   What separates Munk Munk's Legendary Nut Milk Bag from the competition? It's simple really. We precisely cut and stitch it with double-reinforced seams, called \"safety stitches\". If you wonder why we choose to use \"safety stitches\", it's because these seams are designed to withstand the most rigorous stresses. Their most common use in making canvas tarps. So they more than strong enough for our nut milk bags! Our Guarantee It's because of this that we're able to make a guarantee unlike any other you've seen for nut milk bags. Contact us for any reason within 365 days and we will refund your money no questions asked. So order now and when you do, why not get two? One for you and one for a friend. Nut milk bags make great gifts for people that are vegan or simply enjoy living a healthy lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91m8DqNVYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Munk Munk's","source_asin":"B00PJ7LK0I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PJ7LK0I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PJ7LK0I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
