window.products.push({"id":397415,"name":"MobiBrewer 2.0 (Updated April 2022), Portable Coffee Maker, Single Serve Coffee Maker, 12v Coffee Maker, K cup coffee maker, travel coffee maker, car ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t-hBkpBZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mobibrewer 2.0 is a fully automatic portable coffee maker and travel mug, combined into one. This second-generation brewer is the fastest, most convenient 12-volt K-cup coffee brewing device on the market today. Designed for portability and ease of use, you can now brew your coffee at some of the most inconvenient times. It’s lightweight, sleek, and just downright enjoyable to use. Take on the world with your own personal, germ-free coffee brewing device! HOW IT WORKS: For use with water of any temperature, choose from 3 different modes: 12v vehicle adapter (included), wall outlet adapter (sold separately), or external lithium battery (for complete portability - sold separately). Simply pour 8oz (9oz max) of any temperature water after opening the lid, place a K-cup into the K-cup holder positioned in the top opening , close the lid and you are ready to brew! FOR VEHICLE USE: Just plug in the Mobibrewer to your 12V vehicle adapter (included) for a fully automatic experience. Push the brew button and off you go! FOR WALL OUTLET USE: Just plug in the Mobibrewer to your AC/DC wall adapter (sold separately) for a fully automatic experience. FOR COMPLETE PORTABILITY: Just plug in the Mobibrewer to your external lithium-ion battery (In development and sold separately) for a fully automatic experience. AAA BATTERY USE (not included): Please note that the Mobibrewer DOES NOT have a built-in battery at this time for heating. There is a slot in the bottom for two AAA batteries. This will not heat water but will allow you to brew a cup of coffee with the addition of hot water to the top chamber. If you want complete portability, buy our separate 12V lithium battery as an accessory! WHAT’S INCLUDED: Mobibrewer 2.0, 12v vehicle adapter for automobile use, Instruction manual, Loose coffee grounds holder **This product is protected by numerous issued United States utility patent claims.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t-hBkpBZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"One Mug Brewers","source_asin":"B09517JN34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09517JN34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09517JN34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
