window.products.push({"id":397500,"name":"12 Pack 100% Beeswax Taper Candles: 7/8 Inch Thick, 9.5 Inch Tall, Fits All Standard Candle Holders. Long Burning Candles. Perfect House Warming Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sFjPbpFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each hand made naturally scented beeswax candle is 9 1/2 inches long and will burn for approximately 9 hours. Make your evening dinners or nights in special with the natural light emitted by the naturally beeswax unscented candles. No fillers, just beeswax and a 100% cotton wick will ensure long slow burn time. A great housewarming gift for old world or modern decor. A home gifts set to brighten up any occasion. FITS STANDARD TAPER CANDLE HOLDERS: Each tapered candle set has a slight \"wedge\" shape at the base to secure them in your candle holders. 7/8 inches at the base will fit securely into the candle sticks. BEWARE buying other candle Tapers or long candles with a narrow base - they will not securely fit standard candle sticks. They are an ideal House warming presents for new home. Our Bees wax candles for home scented with only natural beeswax. There is no chemicals fragrance added. Pure beeswax candles tapers are naturally coloured by the pollen the bees brush onto beeswax from their hives and give off a beautiful glow and look stylish as centerpiece table decorations. These naturally scented candles gift set are ideal housewarming gifts or as wedding centerpieces for tables These romantic candles will enhance your dining room decor. The beautiful, bright orange and yellow rays of a lit beeswax candle are the perfect stress relief gifts for tired eyes that are caused by the blue-white light from computers, TVs and cell phones. The long lasting candles are dripless, but it is important to keep the candle out of drafts. Suitable for both short burn times as well as long burning burning candles all in one go. Always trim the candle wick to 1cm before lighting. We are JUST AN EMAIL AWAY. Whether you bought this for some beautiful home accessories or as a gift, if you don’t love it we will provide you with a replacement or full refund, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sFjPbpFKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3 Bees","source_asin":"B095WWQ9LK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095WWQ9LK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095WWQ9LK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
