window.products.push({"id":397538,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room Home 4.5L Top Fill Cool Mist Humidifiers for Families Plants Indoor with Humidity Sensor, Customized Humidity, Nigh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P17LqhOKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE CAPACITY HUMIDIFIERS: Cool mist humidifiers for bedroom with triple purification, smart humidification system. The 4.5 liter/1.2 gallon water tank is designed for rooms up to 550 sq ft & lasts up to 40 hours. Smart humidification system incorporates four types of humidity control: auto mode, baby mode ,constant humidity & 3 speed options. Touch button controls & advanced speed slider. LEAKPROOF/TOP FILL/EASY TO CLEAN: The top fill humidifier features a detachable water tank with a secure built-in handle and an extra wide opening for easy filling and cleaning. The top fill construction ensures reliable and leak proof operation for many years. And our humidifiers comes with a little tray that you can put a pad in it and drops essential oil on as you need. EASY TO USE AND MORE HEALTH: Convenient and easy-to-operate design concept, our humidifiers equipped with remote control and ceramic filter. Replaceable ceramic filter element with active carbon & mineral pellets purifies water, keeps it fresh & prevents odour. Create a healthy living space in a professional way! ULTRA QUIET/SLEEP MODE/12 HOUR TIMER: 4.5L large capacity bedroom humidifier produces a near silent frequency (<28dB) ensuring ultra quiet operation for a full night of sleep. Sleep mode deactivates all lights and sounds making it perfect for babies, kids, seniors and sensitive sleepers. The 12-hour timer lets you program operation to save energy. Automatically turns off when you add water to prevent unit damage and keep you safe. SUITABLE FOR ALL KINDS OF OCCASIONS: Multipurpose humidifier, can be placed in living room, bedroom, office, plant room, etc. Keep your ambient humidity above 45% for easy relief from stuffy nose, dry skin, itchy nose and throat. It can not only protect hardwood floors and furniture from cracking during the heating season, but also make your life more moist and healthy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P17LqhOKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"freshpro","source_asin":"B0B3MQ3CXX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3MQ3CXX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3MQ3CXX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
