window.products.push({"id":397600,"name":"COMOOO 12oz Stainless Steel Coffee Mug with Handle Set of 2 Double Wall Vacuum Travel Coffee Mug Insulated Tumbler Cup with Sliding Lid for Hot and Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61peASMu6VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【BPA-free & Rust-proof】- The 12oz coffee mug is 100% BPA free and easy to clean. Our coffee mug is made of food grade 18/8 stainless steel which won’t rust or tarnish.Premium material makes the travel mug durable and resistant to breakdowns. 【Keep Drinks Hot or Cold Longer】-The stainless steel mug is double-walled and vacuum insulated. 2 layers of insulation could maintain your drink hot for up to 6 hours and cold for up to 24 hours. The vacuum insulation design could also protect your hand from frostbit by the cold water or feeling hot for the hot bevarage. 【Handle Design and Sweat Proof】- The metal coffee mugs are designed with handle, easy for gripping. The powder coating on the surfacemake the cup more durable and look more textured.The sweat-proof design could keep your hand dry so you could feel more comfortable when using the coffee mug. 【Coffee Mug with Lid】- COMOOO 12oz insulated coffee mug is lightweight and comes with a lid, which could make your beverage from being dirty by dust and insects. Enjoy favorite coffee,icy cold beer, juice or cocktail with the mug when at home, camping,at the beach, by the pool or on the boat. 【Your 100% Satisfaction Is Our Goal】- Our stainless steel mug is perfect for indoor and outdoor activities suach as breakfast,parties,camping and BBQs. It's also a great gift for Father's Day, Mother's Day and your family's and friends' birthday. If you aren't completely satisfied, please feel free to contact us, we will solve all the problems for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61peASMu6VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COMOOO","source_asin":"B0837FM7NR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0837FM7NR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0837FM7NR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":397601,"name":"URRED Futon Sofa Bed Futon Couch - Sleeper Sofa Bed Futon with Storage Ottoman/Coffee Table, 2 Lumbar Pillows, Adjustable Convertible Tufted Futon Sle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KBdUOWmWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍷【Futon sofa bed set & Innovation】 This Futon sofa bed set includes two sofa bed chairs, a convertible footstool or coffee table, and two small waist pillows. Innovation: The seat height of the sofa is increased by 1.2'', and the upgrade from 13.8'' to 15'' is more suitable for adults; a detachable extended backrest is added, and the height of the backrest is upgraded from 13.6'' to 17.6'' to provide better support for the back. 🍷【Convertible footstool or coffee table】 This futon sofa bed with ottoman, you can use the fabric surface of ottoman as an ordinary footstool, put your feet on it, enjoy your reading time. Turn the lid over you can use wooden surface as a coffee table. The flat small table top can hold wine glasses, drinks, fruit plates, snacks, etc., allowing you to enjoy your leisure time. In addition, this futon couch's ottoman also has a storage function to facilitate your storage. 🍷【Converts into a bed】 The back of sofa bed futon is with three gear positions, which can meet different daily needs. Make a quick guest bed for visitors. Go from love seat to sleeper in seconds. The bed's dimension is: 66' 'x 33'', If you are taller than 5'-7'', you can place the footrest on the side of the bed to extend the length of the bed to 6'-7'', then the bed size is 79 '' x 33'', Can meet the needs of 99% height. 🍷【8+ combination form】 The \"\"Transformers\"\" in Futon bed has more than 8 combinations to meet your different usage scenarios: Loveseat + footstool (front or middle), Loveseat + coffee table (front or Put in the middle) , bed + footstool, extra long bed (the footstool is also added to the bed), single chair + footstool, two single chairs + coffee table, etc. More combinations are waiting for you to explore. 🍷【Other features & Dimensions】 Under the seat edge of the single chair, there is a Velcro to reinforce the connection when combining. Under the backrest, there is an extended wooden structure support, which increases stability while ensuring that it will not roll over when turned into a bed. Two small lumbar pillows provide better support for your waist. When the bed is in shape, the lumbar pillow can be used as a headrest. Loveseat, 33'' x 17.8'' x 29.5''; Footstool, 33'' x 13.4'' x 13.8''.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KBdUOWmWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"URRED","source_asin":"B08Y1S7GQ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y1S7GQ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y1S7GQ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
