window.products.push({"id":397606,"name":"ONEOMI Kids Apron, Medium, 100% Cotton With An Adjustable Strap to fit All Ages","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D2Qdc2J+L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Adjustable Bib Apron Our 100% Twill Cotton Kids Apron has an adjustable strap to adjust to most Ages and Heights. The children will love this Lightweight yet Enduring and Soft Feel Quality while using them for all their fun activities like Cooking, Baking and Painting. These colorful and functional aprons are perfect for any event or activity. The simplicity of the aprons allows for easy apron customization projects, such as embroidery, fabric paint, and dye. Quality you can rely on ONEOMI Aprons are made with high quality durable twill 100% cotton to prevent spill and protect your clothes from getting dirty. Kids aprons are perfect for cooking, parties, painting and more. Aprons are machine washable. Great and essential for any of your kids needs with multiple colors choices. Washing and Care Instructions Wash: Use Cold water, Color Separated; DO NOT use bleach. Do not use fabric softener (coats the cotton fibers causing towel to become less absorbent).  Dry aprons in Tumble cycle to minimize shrinkage.  May be ironed with low heat, do not iron before washing. Q&A Q: What size is the apron? A: ONEOMI medium size aprons are 23.6” (60cm) long and 15.7” (40cm) wide, neck strap adjustable for all kids, boys and girls. Q: Will this fit age from 5 to 12? A: Yes. Q: What age is the boy on product listing picture? A: Boy is 12 years old, 4 feet 9” tall, and weighs 80lb. Q: Can this apron be embroidered or painted with markers? A: Absolutely yes. Q: Can this be machine washed? A: Yes, please read washing label.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D2Qdc2J+L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ONEOMI","source_asin":"B07Y9KPJ8D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y9KPJ8D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y9KPJ8D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
