window.products.push({"id":397730,"name":"Bestronair Wall Mount Fan Oscillating,Industrial Heavy Duty Metal 3 Speed Fan,20 Inch High Velocity Adjustable Tilt,Use for Garage, Shop,Warehouse, Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oXllVCUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【Flexible Head Oscillation】Our wall mount fan are equipped with 120 degrees horizontally oscillation,and 60 degrees of vertical tilt manual adjustment.Oscillating fan can be adapted to your airflow needs from different angles.The air in the corner of the room can be effectively pushed to achieve rapid cooling. 💦【3 Speeds Settings】We set wall mount fan 3 wind speeds, low, medium and high, in order to meet your needs for cooling in different application scenarios.The maximum wind is up to 5500 CFM,which can provide a large amount of airflow for large area ventilation. 💦【Upgrade motor】We use copper wire motor compared with the general aluminum motor is more durable。Pure copper wire is less resistive than aluminum wire, and the current becomes smoother, which effectively improves heat generation and thus becomes more energy efficient, and the noise generated with the resistance is also reduced.This greatly enhances the comfort level when using. 💦【Secured Scientific Use】Taking into account the characteristics of the rotational balance, we specially adopt the design of 3 fan blades, which can make the motor load in a stable state, not the more fan blades the better. In addition, the aluminum fan blade is hard, so the wind is stable and strong, and not easy to deformation durable.The grille has a painting process on the surface, which makes the fan not easy to rust. The dense grid spacing makes it difficult for fingers to slide in, reducing potential safety hazards . 💦【Durable steel neckt】The wall mounted fans can be installed on the wall to save more space.Fitted with durable steel neck, metal rod soldered securely, package includes expansion screws and fittings for mounting.The industrial high velocity fan is not only suitable for factory, but also for garage,outdoor patios, shop, commercial,warehouse, hotel and anywhere else you need a fan. 💌【Warranty Policy】Our product is guaranteed for 2 years from the date of purchase, and it will be replaced free of charge if there is a quality problem within one year.If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will do our best to solve your after-sales problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oXllVCUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestronair","source_asin":"B0BQR6NW8H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQR6NW8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQR6NW8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
