window.products.push({"id":397805,"name":"You Don't Have To Be Crazy To Work Here, We'll Train You - 11oz White Coffee Mug - Cute Sarcastic Office Gag Gifts For Bosses, Ceo, Managers, Employee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615vr5e3MxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Let Your Mug Speak For You: Our unusual You Don't Have to Be Crazy to Work Here, We'll Train You mug is witty enough to make anyone smile, whether you use it at home or at your workplace, at your desk or in the break room. Share a smile with anyone on your gift list, whether they’re a boss, co-worker, employee, friend, family member, significant other, or anyone else. Break the ice with new co-workers and in meetings with this zesty, fun coffee mug, or give a gift without going over budget. Lasting Quality: High-quality, smooth ceramic stoneware resists scratches and lasts a long time. The custom imprint is permanent and won’t lose its luster or fade. Your ceramic mug can be used with either hand since the You Don't Have to Be Crazy to Work Here, We'll Train You design is printed on two sides. Good for Any Occasion, these mugs hold plenty of liquid and make great gifts for all of your special occasions: anniversaries, bachelor and bachelorette parties, and birthdays. Safe for the Microwave and Dishwasher: Use your mug again and again in the microwave. Wash it in the dishwasher after every use and still never worry about the design fading away or peeling over time. Cold and hot temperatures will not affect the high quality of your ceramic stoneware mug, so you’ll feel confident to use it every day. Great bride and groom gifts, Christmas, honeymoon, thinking-of-you gifts for long-distance relationships, Valentine’s Day, wedding engagements, you name it. Fun Way to Break the Ice: Your new ceramic coffee cup displays You Don't Have to Be Crazy to Work Here, We'll Train You on both sides so you can both laugh over your coffee or tea in the morning. The double-sided design makes an ideal gift for a new bride and groom or a wonderful housewarming present. Surprise your spouse with this cute, thoughtful gift for your anniversary or any time you want to show you care. Carefully Packed, Satisfaction Is Guaranteed: 100% customer satisfaction is our goal. To make sure each ceramic mug arrives at its new home safe and sound. Our durable new packaging delivers the high-quality mugs to you reliably. If you ever find a craftsmanship or materials defect in any of our mugs, simply contact our friendly and responsive customer service folks. We stand behind all of our carefully crafted and packed products and will work with you to find a solution that’s pleasing to you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615vr5e3MxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crazy Bros Tees","source_asin":"B07BL4YP92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BL4YP92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BL4YP92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
