window.products.push({"id":397837,"name":"Hamilton Beach Electric Hand Mixer, 6-Speed, with Snap-On Case, Twisted Wire Beaters, Milkshake Rod, Dough Hook, Whisk, Blue (62622)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FQv5lqIsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Hamilton Beach performance hand mixer features twisted wire beaters designed for fast and easy mixing, and less clogging. The mixer has 6 speeds to make easy work of all your recipes, a QuickBurst button, and a pulse function. The mixer comes with everything you need to start mixing. You get 6 attachments and a Snap-On storage case. The attachments include: 2 twisted wire beaters, a milkshake blending rod, dough hooks, and a whisk. A convenient eject trigger makes it easy to remove attachments for cleaning. The pulse function works on the slowest speed for added control and less mess. And the QuickBurst button gives you an extra burst of power when you need it. The mixer has 290 watts of peak power to easily handle every mixing job, Whether you're combining ingredients for your favorite dip, making a batch of homemade cookies, preparing fresh bread dough, or whipping cream to top a delicious pie.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FQv5lqIsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B00P26LAOM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P26LAOM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P26LAOM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":397838,"name":"Fall Placemats Set of 4 Wipeable Table Mats Easy to Clean Waterproof Kitchen Mats for Dining Table Outdoor Indoor (4, Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916NpOOOhRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package: 4 Place mats, Good Size:17.8*11.8 inch, ECO Material:PU leather, EVA, Cotton Features: Waterproof dinner mat, easy to clean, nonslip, protect your kitchen table from messes and maintain a quiet dinning environment Home Decor: Wipeble place mat has skins texture, modern and stylish, perfect decoration your home, dinging hall, kitchen, hotel and business office Round PlaceMats are double thickened and both sides can be worked, enhancing the insulation effect, effective heat resistant of approximately 150°F JOVONO Placemats are manufactured with the upmost attention to quality, detail and value. If you have any personal or business needs, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916NpOOOhRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jovono","source_asin":"B08F7DVFS3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7DVFS3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7DVFS3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":397839,"name":"COCOPLOCEUS Boho Pillow Covers 24x24 Set of 2 Throw Pillow Covers Stone Washed Square Pattern Euro Shams Decorative Cushion Covers for Couch Sofa Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cKpvxXXpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton ✅ MATERIAL-- The euro sham pillow covers are made of 100% cotton.It has been pre-washed with water and dried at high temperature,so it can be used directly.Ultra soft, moisture absorb breathable, durable and skin friendly.(Only two pillow covers, no insert) ✅ INVISIBLE ZIPPERS -- 24x24 pillow covers feature a color-matched recessed zipper that enhances security while maintaining an elegant look, and the zipper is hidden at the edge of the pillowcase to protect the skin from scratches. Very easy to insert and replace pillow insert. ✅ STONE WASHED PROCESS -- Square pattern pillowcase using a special stone wash process which is similar to the sanding process of making jeans,make the surface of the formation of color shades of interlocking visual,and the pillow cover more three-dimensional, soft and comfortable. It is a typical decorative pillow case. ✅ DECORATIVE DESIGN -- Geometric pattern with a wide edge small tassel (tassel is hand polished out, there may be a little bit of hair flakes, but does not affect the use), the whole design is decent and generous. They are simultaneously vibrant and soft, and they go well with neutral tones, but add a pop of color.Pillow covers are suitable for car, livingroom, bedroom, party, office, cafe, bed, couch, sofa, seat, bench, etc. ✅ HOW TO CARE -- The decorative pillow covers can be gentle cycle washed in cold water separately.Do not use detergent that contains bleach or whitener. Line dry or tumble dry on medium heat. Do not dry clean. Remove promptly from washing machine to avoid wrinkles. ⭐About the color difference -- ①The color will be different under different monitors. ② Under different brightness of light, 24x24 pillow covers color will also have light and dark changes.The color will be lighter in cooler tones,in the warm light will have a little yellow tone, but not too different from the original color 🎁 Kraft paper box packaging -- Can be given as a gift; the pillow covers may have slight creases when you first open it, which will disappear after a period of use; or you can iron or wash it first to deal with the creases 👉Already washed in advance, open and ready to use 💡 What is stonewash - imitates the process of aging jeans, forming a gradual change in color","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cKpvxXXpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COCOPLOCEUS","source_asin":"B0C16S3ZC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C16S3ZC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C16S3ZC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
