window.products.push({"id":397893,"name":"2 Pack 6 Holes Large Silicone Molds, Semi Sphere Silicone Mold for Chocolate Bombs, Half Silicone Sphere Mold Creative DIY Handmade Mold for Cake, Jel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4x6tXmlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What should I pay attention to before using the silicone mold? ● Can be cleaned with clear water first, take out surface dust, also can use hot water to wash disinfection. ● Apply a thin layer of butter to the surface before baking, and do not apply butter in later baking. ● In the baking process, there is no single mold with batter, and cold water needs to be added, because empty baking will shorten the service life of the silicone molds How should the silicone sphere mold be cleaned? ● Silicone molds can be cleaned using the normal kitchen cleaning method, or they can be placed directly in the dishwasher. ● Do not approach sharp tools or use steel wire ball and other hard cleaning tools to avoid scratches caused by the circle silicone mold. ● After cleaning, air dry quickly in the ventilated place. Do not directly expose to the air when not in use for a long time How should the silicone sphere mold be placed in the oven? ● When baking, place in the middle of the oven and keep a safe distance of 5-10cm from the heating tube. ● Do not contact the walls of the oven directly to prevent the heating tube from damaging the mold Precautions: ▲ Do not use the Crips button in the microwave oven ▲ Do not use olive oil ▲ After baking, take out the baking tray, leave to cool for 10 minutes or so before demoulding, forming more beautiful ▲ After freezing, take out from the refrigerator, immediately demoulding, the effect is best Specification: Material: Food-grade silicone, BPA freePackage Included: 2xsilicone moldsSize: 29*17*3.5cm/11.4*6.7*1.4in, and the diameter of the hemisphere is 6.7cm/2.6in","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4x6tXmlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GJKGG","source_asin":"B08RZ5WNQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RZ5WNQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RZ5WNQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
