window.products.push({"id":397937,"name":"Shark® 2-in-1 Vac Then Steam™ Bagless Vacuum & Steam Mop PLUS Premium Micro-fiber Steam Pads","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gLKGcS6VL._AC_.jpg","description":"In today's busy world, who has time to sweep and mop floors? Introducing Shark 2-in-1 Vac-then-Steam. You start by using the high-powered suction vacuum to pick up dust and particles. Then simply switch to the chemical-free Steam mode for a truly clean and dry hard-floor surface. No more brooms. No more buckets of dirty water. Just clean floors - quick and easy. Vacuum debris and dust before you clean. The Shark 2-in-1 Vac-then-Steam helps you do both. Engineered exclusively for hard floor cleaning, it converts from Vac to Steam in seconds. The continuous powerful suction picks up dust and debris, then the super-heated steam cleans on all your hard floor surfaces. The unique steam technology turns simple tap water into super-heated steam that infuse the micro-fiber pads for chemical free cleaning. The Shark Vac-then-Steam can help you achieve a truly clean and healthy environment for you and your family. Converts from Vac to Steam in seconds Safe on all sealed hard floor surfaces: hardwood, linoleum, tile, marble and stone  Superior cleaning, fast drying micro-fiber cleaning pads that are washable & reusable Telescopic handle with adjustable height Premium bare-floor suction performance Floors dry in seconds Less time spent on hard-floor cleaning More than 15 minutes of steam cleaning power with one tank of water Easy-to-replenish water tank Lightweight system that's easy to move around Extra long 30 foot power cord Water capacity: 10 oz. Voltage: 120 Volts, 60 HZ  Power: 1550 Watts ETL Listed Weight: 9.5 lbs. Dimensions: 45\" L x 7.8\" D x 11.2\" W","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gLKGcS6VL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shark","source_asin":"B004IRTRQE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004IRTRQE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004IRTRQE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
