window.products.push({"id":397939,"name":"MCombo Electric Power Lift Recliner Chair Sofa with Massage and Heat for Elderly, Extended Footrest, Hand Remote Control, 2 Side Pockets, Cup Holders,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":619.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kBQmUqG1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you start the installation: You will receive two boxes and a detailed instruction manual for the chair. Please read manual before assembling the chair. Assembling the chair is easy and no tools are needed. (If you do not receive the second box the same day, please be patient and it's coming.) When you first sit in the chair: Thickening padding and backrest shaped with unique cloth line will provide unexpected sense of wrapping. Built-in springs in both of back and seat, thick cushion will give you the ultimate comfort sitting in the chair. The selected faux leather is also easy to take care of. When you need to stand or lie down to rest: The big buttons of the lift remote are more tactile feel. Press the \"up\" button and the single lift motor with TUV certified actuator will gently push up the entire chair to help you stand up.Press the \"down\" button and the electric lift smoothly adjusts to reclining position you prefer. When you need to relax: It comes with 8 vibrating points around the chair and 1 lumbar heating point. By selecting massage intensity and speed, select the vibrating points to relax tired muscles of back or leg. Meanwhile it can also be timed. (The heating function works separately from the vibrating function.) Expect More: The dual USB ports and cup holders in the recliner will allow you to put your drink on the cup holder and charge your mobile devices all while enjoying a movie or enjoying your favorite apps. TIPS: 1. Max reclining angle: 140°. 2. Recommended height: 5'1\"-5'9\". 3. If you have any concerns regarding your health, consult your doctor before using the product. 4. Any questions? Contact us now, we will got you within 12 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kBQmUqG1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCombo","source_asin":"B0B8MPNFJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8MPNFJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8MPNFJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
