window.products.push({"id":397994,"name":"Granbest 3 Piece Stretch Sofa Slipcover Separate Cushion Couch Covers Thick Premium Loveseat Slipcover Jacquard Loveseat Sofa Cover for 2 Cushion Couc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GBvznjuZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT FIT: This updated 2 piece sofa cover slipcover includes 1 sofa cover and 2 cushion covers, especially designed for those sofas with separate cushions. Made of spandex and polyester blend, this sofa slip cover is super stretch. Plus, with individual cushion covers and elastic closure, this magic sofa cover will stay in place more firmly and fit better. THICK FABRIC&UNIQUE DESIGN: Featuring exclusive patterns in soft thick fabric and solid coloring, Granbest couch cover will create a sense of modern charm and instantly rejuvenate any living room. The thickened fabric is more durable, strong and lasts for years to come. It enhances the decor of your home while giving your guests a soft and comfy seating area. FULL PROTECTION: This elastic sofa cover provides an all-round protection for your sofa like a guardian. It not only deters scratching, pet hairs and damages, it also helps reduce fading and is resistant to stains. Our couch covers for sofa are an ideal choice for families with children or pets. It will definitely improve the quality of life. MEASURE SIZE: Please measure your sofa before choosing our sofa slipcovers, our large size is suitable for sofa length between 71\"-92\" , medium size is suitable for sofa length 56\"-70\", small size is suitable for sofa length 30-47 inch. Each chair cushion cover measures up to 20-25 inch length, 20-27.5. 5 inch wide, 2-9 inch thickness. For detailed measuring guide, please check our attached picture. EASY CARE AND INSTALLATION: 1.Remove the seat cushions from furniture. 2.Find two \"BACK\" labels in the seam of sofa slipcover and locate the them at the left and right corners of furniture's back. 3. Cover the furniture from back to front by following the seams and tuck in extra fabric. 4.Cover seat cushions and put them back to furniture. Machine washable in cold water for easy care and maintenance. Gentle cycle and tumble dry low. Do Not Bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GBvznjuZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Granbest","source_asin":"B092R7Z3PB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-397994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092R7Z3PB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092R7Z3PB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
